WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:35.860
Um, what seems to be the issue?

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:39.240
The foul stench of Sacred Beasts pollutes the air!

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:42.200
I can't contain this fury!

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:50.490
Why, do you have something to say?!

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:51.950
No..!

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:57.040
So if we win this battle, we'll have to go up against <i>them</i>.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:00.720
Come to think of it, they're pretty pitiful, too.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.710
They're only like that because of the Euro Team.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.580
Let's focus on beating Europe for now.

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:08.560
Those other guys come later.

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:13.910
To think I'd be fighting an opponent already defeated...

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:16.910
This whole thing is a farce, but I'll play along.

00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:20.160
Enough chatter. Prepare yourself!

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:26.920
Settle it! The Power to Win.

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:30.610
Now, let's head into the second set!

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:31.930
Are you ready?

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:40.890
I'm not fighting for the BBA!

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:43.090
I'm fighting for myself!

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:45.480
Let's count it down!

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:49.220
Three! Two! One!

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:53.860
Go... Shoot!

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:56.780
Go... Shoot!

00:03:04.090 --> 00:03:06.170
I'll crush you, just like Iast time!

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:14.260
Oh, man! What in the world is happening?

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.790
The Bey was engulfed by flames!

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:18.340
Fire Rod!

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:25.150
Come forth, Suzaku!

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:36.030
What?!

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:40.320
Your Fire Rod is no more!

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.030
That's Kai for ya!

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.500
Who knew he had this planned?

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:47.910
That Kai fellow...

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.860
He's a lot like us.

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:53.040
He doesn't rely on others, and only trusts himself.

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:55.380
In that regard, he reminds me of myself.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:58.410
But in sheer power, he's inferior to Johnny.

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:04.280
Dranzer charges through the fire and the flames!

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:06.450
Is Kai going for the kill?!

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.760
Flame Saber!

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:09.810
Fool.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:12.220
What?!

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:16.080
Your luck ended when you got
up close! I won't let you escape!

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:20.670
Suzaku!

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:25.610
What's going on?! Dranzer suddenly stopped attacking, and is now spinning out of control!

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:29.060
This is Johnny's true power. What do you think, Olivier?

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:32.050
Our victory is an eventuality, is it not?

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:33.790
I sure hope so.

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:37.100
But the BBA has something we do not.

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:41.340
Until we find what that aspect is, the
outcome of Johnny's battle will remain uncertain.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:48.220
Show me how much your Sacred Beast can take!

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:53.900
Why you..!

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:55.160
Kai!

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:58.980
That tail-grip is powerful!
Breaking free won't be easy!

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:01.290
Is there some way we can help him?

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:03.130
Silence!

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:05.210
I don't need anyone's help!

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:06.270
Stay out of this!

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:09.930
He can't break free from his opponent's hold...

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:13.480
Wait! Didn't something similar happen before..?

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:15.210
I got it!

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:19.840
Kai! Remember my fight at Rome's <i>Colosseo</i>!

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:26.140
Like I said, I don't need your help!

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:29.110
Are you really saying that <i>now</i>, Kai?!

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:36.320
Suzaku will run out of strength soon enough.

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:38.380
And so will your Bey.

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.020
As expected, victory will be mine.

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:41.320
Suzaku!

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:45.150
Fly upward!

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:52.320
This is bad! He's planning to use
the move they used on me in Rome!

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:53.660
Johnny!

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:56.090
Tell Salamalyon to let go of Suzaku!

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:59.430
No way! A bit more, and he'll be all mine!

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:00.670
What?!

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:04.080
Go!

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:10.950
Wow! What in the world is going on?!

00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:14.660
Unbelievable!

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:18.500
Like rockets, the two Beys are soaring into the sky!

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.620
Never in my life have I seen a battle like this!

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:25.080
Johnny, show me how much your Sacred Beast can take!

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.160
Salamalyon!

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:44.380
All right!

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:47.140
To think they'd win twice using the same strategy..!

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:49.100
We even tried to help...

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:54.510
You really are much ado about nothing, huh?

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:58.470
The firece battle of the second set...

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:01.790
ends with Kai's victory!

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:06.190
Heck yeah! We won!

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:08.270
This really was <i>great</i>!

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:15.250
I'll be quiet...

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:19.320
Kai, great job!

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:20.500
We finally have a win.

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:24.090
I told you to stay out of it!

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:25.720
Do you want me to be indebted to you?!

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:28.240
I didn't think it was that special...

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:31.240
You'll pay for this.

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:32.310
Kai...

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:35.600
Don't you dare lose to them.

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:42.040
That's all the gratitude you'll get from him.

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:43.690
I know, I know.

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:46.860
I'm going to win the third set for sure.

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:50.070
We can't waste the opportunity that Kai made for us.

00:07:50.890 --> 00:07:55.400
I have to win, so we can fight
in the finals with our heads held high.

00:07:56.220 --> 00:07:58.050
Aha... I've got it!

00:07:58.680 --> 00:07:59.520
Yes?

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:04.160
That something I've sensed since the day I met them,

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:07.910
as well as the sense of anxiety felt by Olivier...

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:11.150
I'm sure it's the power of friendship!

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:12.520
The power of friendship?

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:14.970
You said it earlier.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:17.460
Kai resembles us.

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:21.520
But the advantage he had was advice from his friends.

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:26.110
He followed it and won. On the
other hand, Johnny ignored it and lost.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:33.610
Their feelings for their teammates
have become a source of power in battle.

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:35.630
I think I understand.

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:38.870
It's the same uneasiness I felt when fighting Rei.

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:46.640
Forming packs is foolish. We don't need teams.
In that mindset, we rejected the World Tournament.

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:53.140
But a real team can bring out a
power larger than the sum of its parts!

00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:55.100
I won't acknowledge your idiotic ideas!

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:58.070
Friends? Relying on others?

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:01.260
Those only serve to make you weaker!

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:05.400
True power comes from believing in,
relying on, and forging one's self.

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:09.080
It is only born from solitary, hard work.

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:14.390
These beliefs are my own—and
they're supposed to be all of Europe's, too!

00:09:14.390 --> 00:09:16.670
Ralf! What's your stance?

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:19.890
The power of friendship... may exist.

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:20.810
What did you say?!

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:26.040
You lost, and that's a fact. We must
come to recognize that their power exists.

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:32.340
Still, I don't believe that it can overcome our own.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:32.970
Ralf...

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:39.010
And I will prove it to you by
utterly destroying Takao in the next battle.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:52.280
My, my, I'm quite late.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:55.620
Oh, that must be the Jurgens Stadium!

00:09:56.140 --> 00:10:00.490
The BBA Team is in there right now.

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:17.480
I have no idea who's going to win this!

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:20.050
It makes no difference!

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:22.850
No matter the victor, we shall bathe in their blood!

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:24.430
Still...

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.380
What's wrong, Vlad?

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:29.740
With them face-to-face, I've noticed something.

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:34.150
Both use Sacred Beasts, but the BBA has something else.

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:36.750
Something else?

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:37.580
Yeah...

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:42.560
Alright! My time to shine.

00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:43.580
Hey, Takao!

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:46.370
This is the final battle.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:47.880
Give it your all.

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:50.230
Yeah! Let's do this.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.130
Takao, we're counting on you.

00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:53.350
You got it!

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:59.060
The air in the Jurgens Stadium is heating up
as we come to the climax of the Exhibition Match!

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:04.670
Will the BBA keep their momentum and seize
victory? Or will the Euros make a comeback?

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:07.680
Our third match—the one to end it all—is starting!

00:11:10.090 --> 00:11:11.100
It's been a long time.

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:13.350
I wouldn't say that.

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:17.070
Not when faced with the hellish time that awaits.

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:18.660
You can talk the talk!

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:20.670
Alright, here we go!

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:22.240
Are you ready?

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:42.580
The power of friendship?

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:46.520
As if something as foolish as
that could overcome our power!

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:49.160
Three, Two, One!

00:11:50.030 --> 00:11:52.390
Go... Shoot!

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:05.820
Go, Dragoon!

00:12:10.140 --> 00:12:12.630
Merely awakening your Beast won't be enough.

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.100
Grifolyon!

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:21.150
Holy cow!

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:23.760
A violent storm is enveloping the stadium!

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:26.720
Wing Dagger!

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:35.070
I can't back down now!

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:41.240
Takao! Move diagonally!

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:43.700
Those feathers only move straight ahead!

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:47.920
That's right! So you can close
the distance by moving in <i>zig-zags</i>...

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:51.830
...And hit the opponent's blind spot! Alright!

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:55.220
Again with the advice...

00:12:55.390 --> 00:12:57.920
The flow of the battle is going to change.

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:00.470
Dragoon is closing in on Grifolyon!

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:02.920
Go, Dragoon!

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:07.880
What?!

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:11.850
Grifolyon knows moves other
than just Wind Dagger, you know.

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:16.360
Seiryuu!

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:22.080
With this, I prove that the power
of our beliefs far exceed your own.

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:23.280
What's that?!

00:13:23.850 --> 00:13:27.500
You should admit that your friends aren't reliable.

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:33.900
I have no idea what you're saying. Rei, Max,
Kai, and the Professor always look out for me.

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:36.880
I could never call them unreliable!

00:13:37.060 --> 00:13:39.450
Then I'm left with no other choice.

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:43.440
You must wake up and be shown the cold, hard truth.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.010
Grifolyon!

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:49.090
Seiryuu!

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:53.360
Now your Sacred Beast will lose its freedom.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:56.530
That's how Grifolyon attacks!

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:02.940
I can't believe my eyes!

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:07.210
Dragoon is taking each and every
one of Grifolyon's attacks head-on!

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:09.100
Takao! Seiryuu!

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:09.710
Wait!

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:11.300
Don't go.

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:13.720
But at this rate, Takao is going to..!

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:16.740
He's not fighting this battle alone.

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:19.410
Unsurprisingly, you've lost all control.

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:23.970
Now, Grifolyon! Give him a taste of your final move!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.290
Stop!

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:33.630
I can't believe it! You took Grifolyon's
attack in order to shield your Sacred Beast?!

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:42.610
I can't let you keep hurting Seiryuu!

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:49.220
He's my brother in arms,
and he fights Bey battles alongside me.

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:51.030
Seiryuu is my friend, too!

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:53.070
The Sacred Beast is your friend..?

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:55.660
What?!

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:58.360
I can't believe it! It broke free!

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:02.530
His Sacred Beast is showing
more power than ever before!

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:08.890
Takao's bond with his
Sacred Beast made it more powerful?!

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:11.520
Where's this crazy energy coming from?

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:19.150
He's fighting among friends. This is, as you said,
the difference between us and the Euro team.

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:20.360
<i>That</i> is..?

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.850
I won't accept such strength!

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:31.620
Enough! Grifolyon, don't stop
attacking until you take him down!

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:39.760
Holy cow! The tables have turned!

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:44.220
No matter how much Grifolyon attacks,
Dragoon is <i>not</i> backing down!

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:45.360
Ralf!

00:15:45.950 --> 00:15:47.770
Johnny! What are you doing?!

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:50.390
Are you going to interfere with their battle?!

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:52.920
With the way things are going, Ralf will lose!

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:57.690
Do you want this humiliating
defeat to be broadcast all over Europe?!

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.030
Stay there.

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:06.080
I wish to witness this battle's outcome.

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:10.340
Not yet! Don't let up on the offensive!

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:13.420
You're using your Sacred Beast like a tool.

00:16:13.760 --> 00:16:17.320
Of course! Sacred Beasts are tools made for battle.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.540
Then we won't lose to you.

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:26.040
We can't afford to lose to someone like you, who
doesn't see Sacred Beasts as comrades or friends!

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:28.260
Silence! Grifolyon!

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:29.420
Seiryuu!

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:34.600
Are they finally looking to end it?!

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:36.340
They're about to crash head-on!

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:48.170
Takao!

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:50.280
Ralf!

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:04.700
Takao!

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:06.030
Are you alright?

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:07.470
How'd it end?

00:17:14.120 --> 00:17:15.200
Are you okay?

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:16.200
Takao...

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:20.140
I lost.

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:22.650
Ralf! Are you going to accept defeat?!

00:17:23.860 --> 00:17:27.640
I never thought of anyone as a friend.

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:30.050
Naturally, that goes for my Sacred Beast as well.

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:33.390
That's why I never thought twice
about ordering Grifolyon around.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:39.330
But because of that, he lacked
the power to fend off Seiryuu's attack.

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:46.040
Are you saying that this wouldn't have
happened if you had seen Grifolyon as a friend?

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:50.300
In the end, I lost to my own way of thinking.

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:54.050
That is, my not thinking of anyone as a friend.

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:56.890
"I can do everything by myself."

00:17:57.480 --> 00:17:59.550
Your line of thinking was far too arrogant.

00:17:59.900 --> 00:18:02.370
In the end, we were wrong.

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:05.300
So the battle is over, huh?

00:18:07.130 --> 00:18:08.350
Team Shadow!

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:10.960
Already?! Where's the hurry?

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:14.320
No, my opponents will be them!

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:18.760
We used to hate all Sacred Beast users.

00:18:19.390 --> 00:18:24.870
But we'll only direct that hate towards cold-hearted
Beast users with no regard for others' feelings.

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:27.590
The BBA is not like that.

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:29.820
Very well.

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:30.870
Ralf!

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:33.930
It's our fault you've become what you are.

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:35.520
Do as you please.

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:38.930
Ralf, I hated your group.

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:42.160
Yes, so much that I wished to kill you.

00:18:45.610 --> 00:18:47.050
Wait, Vlad!

00:18:48.300 --> 00:18:50.930
But there's no longer a need for that.

00:18:51.840 --> 00:18:53.960
The old you has already died,

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:55.570
thanks to this battle.

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:02.940
You took the revenge we yearned for.

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:03.950
Thank you.

00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:05.220
Vlad...

00:19:08.050 --> 00:19:09.900
What caused this explosion..?

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:16.760
Ah! So this means...

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:20.770
The exhibition match ends with the BBA's victory!

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:37.310
Impressive how you managed to get
some of Europe's most illustrious families into it.

00:19:37.460 --> 00:19:40.470
That goes to show how exciting the battle truly was.

00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:42.570
It really was a great battle.

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:44.740
President Daitenji!

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:46.520
W-Why are you here?

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:49.010
You sure have grown a lot.

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:52.130
After all, you went through a lot of hardships.

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:53.870
A lot of hardships?

00:19:53.870 --> 00:19:56.620
So you know what happened to us?!

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:57.840
Of course.

00:19:57.990 --> 00:19:59.880
W-What's going on?

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:02.380
Does this face look familiar at all?

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:06.340
Ah! That face..!

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:10.260
It's the old geezer that made us miss our ship!

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:12.780
Dang, you really got us!

00:20:13.140 --> 00:20:13.770
Voila!

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:17.610
I couldn't believe that none of you noticed.

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.930
Why did you do all this?

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:27.900
I wanted you to be stronger for your battles
in the final round of the World Tournament.

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:29.240
Be stronger?

00:20:30.050 --> 00:20:37.130
I wanted you to broaden your horizons by facing opponents that fight in a way unknown to you,

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:39.290
like the Europeans and the Shadows.

00:20:39.480 --> 00:20:41.640
W-Well, I guess we did...

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:47.030
So, how was it?

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:50.110
Did this journey teach you anything?

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:52.650
You bet it did!

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:57.900
And thanks to today's battle, my
bond with Seiryuu is stronger than ever!

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:04.510
We've come to understand that our power
in battle reflects the strength of our bonds.

00:21:04.850 --> 00:21:07.410
This was definitely one fruitful journey.

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:12.830
Now, the World Tournament finals await us!

00:21:13.090 --> 00:21:13.820
Yeah!

00:21:14.300 --> 00:21:17.130
Takao, fight for us, too!

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:19.060
Leave it to me!

00:21:19.860 --> 00:21:22.360
The Final Tournament is coming up, and it's about time!

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:27.610
I can hardly wait to see what
kinda powerful opponents we'll meet!

00:21:28.030 --> 00:21:30.050
Let's do this!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.870 --> 00:23:03.960
According to my analysis, we have
finally arrived at the site of the finals—Russia!

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:06.910
Here in Russia, Beyblade is as popular as ever.

00:23:07.240 --> 00:23:08.380
However, it's weird.

00:23:08.790 --> 00:23:17.710
While passing a monastery, we found
dispirited boys undergoing harsh training.

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:20.300
Next time: The final site, Russia.

00:23:20.800 --> 00:23:24.350
This impact! It's so ex-site-ing!
